# All four collaborators are eligible code-owner reviewers on everything in
# the repo. This is deliberately flat rather than split per product
# directory: GitHub never auto-requests a review from a PR's own author, so
# a single-owner directory rule (e.g. "/product-b/ @Cheewaiyip" with no one
# else listed) makes it impossible for that owner's own PRs to satisfy
# "require review from code owners" — nobody else is eligible to approve.
#
# Who actually owns which product day to day is documented in CLAUDE.md /
# AGENTS.md's ownership table — this file only exists to keep the required
# code-owner review satisfiable by someone other than the author.
